# Git LFS tracking for large dissertation PDF files, including reader assets.
dissertation/**/*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Force LF line endings for the OKF/wiki knowledge bundle and its generated
# artifacts. The OKF tooling parses frontmatter with `lines[0] === '---'` and
# diffs the generated inventory/seed byte-for-byte. On Windows (core.autocrlf=true)
# these files check out as CRLF, which breaks frontmatter detection and the
# exact-match regeneration tests. CI runs on Linux (LF), so pinning eol=lf keeps
# local Windows checkouts consistent with CI.
wiki/**/*.md text eol=lf
wiki/**/*.json text eol=lf
data/wiki-content/**/*.md text eol=lf
data/wiki-seed.json text eol=lf
